    "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued September 19 at 6:26AM EDT by NWS Blacksburg VA",
    "description": "Visibilities are a half mile or less across portions of the\nmountains this morning. The fog will impact travel, especially\nalong I-81 between Chilhowie and Christiansburg and along the\nBlue Ridge, as well as I-64 in southeast West Virginia.\n\nBe alert to rapidly changing visibilities if traveling. Allow\nextra time to get to your destination. The fog should lift between\n9-10am.",
